#------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Quad SPI boot/overlay flash (SST26VF064B) -- NOT used by the monolithic bitstream logic (tied off in the wrapper); constrained so the pins are legally assigned
# Provenance: fpga_pinmap.xdc lines ~546-557 (IOSTANDARD+PACKAGE_PIN), ~970-973 (PULLUP)
#------------------------------------------------------------------------------
